    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10231917ffc78c9754991e7d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和葛城王牌提前度过了\n一个贴心又温暖，\n和平时一样平静的圣诞节──",
      "source_fingerprint": "026dec83604118dbab699f4610b7fdae82708cb94acbf329d49f663a89ff576a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
